    -R[node3036: 2.3.2.18 | -glycyl_tRNA, +tRNA ^L]- MurNAc_L_Ala_D_isoglutaminyl_L_Lys_N6_penta_Gly_D_Ala_D_Ala_diphospho_ditrans_octacis_undecaprenyl_GlcNAc  // N-acetylmuramoyl-L-alanyl-D-glutamyl-L-lysyl-(N6-triglycine)-D-alanyl-D-alanine-diphosphoundecaprenyl-N-acetylglucosamine:glycine glycyltransferase
